---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { release } from '../data/release';
---
<Base title="下载宇海 · 安卓正式版" description={`宇海安卓正式版 ${release.version}，${release.sizeMb} MB，附 SHA-256 与签名证书指纹，方便核对官方版本。`}>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="kicker">下载</span>
      <h1>下载宇海</h1>
      <p>请只从 yhvpn.io 下载。其他地方的安装包可能被人改过。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap dl-grid">
      <div class="dl-card">
        <h2>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.6 9.48 19.44 6.3a.38.38 0 0 0-.66-.38l-1.86 3.22a11.46 11.46 0 0 0-9.84 0L5.22 5.92a.38.38 0 0 0-.66.38L6.4 9.48A10.78 10.78 0 0 0 1 18h22a10.78 10.78 0 0 0-5.4-8.52ZM7 15.25A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 8.25 14 1.25 1.25 0 0 1 7 15.25Zm10 0A1.25 1.25 0 1 1 18.25 14 1.25 1.25 0 0 1 17 15.25Z"/></svg>
          安卓版 <span class="pill live">正式版</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="specs">
          <span>版本 <b>{release.version}</b></span>
          <span>大小 <b>{release.sizeMb} MB</b></span>
          <span>发布 <b>{release.date}</b></span>
          <span>系统 <b>{release.minAndroid} 及以上</b></span>
        </div>
        <div><a class="btn btn-primary" href={release.apk} download>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v12"/><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"/><path d="M5 21h14"/></svg>
          下载安装包
        </a></div>
        <dl class="kv">
          <dt>安装包 SHA-256</dt>
          <dd><span class="hash" id="h-apk">{release.sha256}</span><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="h-apk">复制</button></dd>
        </dl>
        <dl class="kv">
          <dt>签名证书 SHA-256</dt>
          <dd><span class="hash" id="h-cert">{release.certSha256}</span><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="h-cert">复制</button></dd>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="dl-card">
        <h2>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16.4 12.6c0-2.3 1.9-3.4 2-3.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0-3.4-1.8c-1.4-.2-2.8.8-3.5.8s-1.9-.8-3.1-.8a4.6 4.6 0 0 0-3.9 2.4c-1.7 2.9-.4 7.2 1.2 9.5.8 1.1 1.7 2.4 2.9 2.4s1.6-.8 3-.8 1.8.8 3 .7 2-1.1 2.8-2.3a9.6 9.6 0 0 0 1.3-2.6 3.9 3.9 0 0 1-2.3-3.5ZM14.1 5.8A4 4 0 0 0 15 2.9a4.1 4.1 0 0 0-2.7 1.4 3.8 3.8 0 0 0-1 2.8 3.4 3.4 0 0 0 2.8-1.3Z"/></svg>
          iOS 版 <span class="pill">准备中</span>
        </h2>
        <p style="margin:0;color:var(--yh-sub)">iOS 版正在准备中，上线后会在这里更新。</p>
        <div><span class="btn btn-outline" aria-disabled="true">敬请期待</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="wrap dl-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:24px">
          <span class="kicker">安装步骤</span>
          <h2>安卓怎么装</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="howto">
          <li><b>下载安装包。</b>点上面的「下载安装包」，等下载完成。</li>
          <li><b>允许安装。</b>手机提示「禁止安装未知应用」时，按提示允许当前浏览器安装应用。</li>
          <li><b>完成安装。</b>回到下载的文件，点「安装」。</li>
          <li><b>打开宇海注册。</b>账号填你自己钱包的 USDT（TRC20）地址，再设置密码。</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:24px">
          <span class="kicker">注意</span>
          <h2>这些要留意</h2>
        </div>
        <div style="display:grid;gap:16px">
          <p class="notice-card"><b>部分手机需要额外确认。</b>有的系统会要求多走一步「高级安装」确认，这是系统机制，不是应用问题。</p>
          <p class="notice-card"><b>官方网站仅 yhvpn.io。</b>有人冒充我们发安装包时，核对上面的 SHA-256 和签名证书指纹就能识别。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
